%% PythonAnywhere task 1568725 was enabled on 2026-11-21. Its live command hash
%% matched the reviewed command for STRATEGY_DASHBOARD_20261106_001/market_daily_boot.py.
%% 01:20 UTC is the documented schedule. The task inventory omits the current time field.
%% Prepared launcher acquires generation and task locks. Sandbox bars passed
%% ordinary-session verification on 2026-11-23. Early-close verification is pending.
%% scripts/daily_strategy_scan.py selects the completed New York trading session,
%% prepares one dataset, and commits separate archives for the base and companion scans.
%% Non-trading days report SKIPPED_NON_TRADING_DAY.
%% Session files live under jbravo-research-tools/STRATEGY_DAILY_ACTIVATION_20261025_002/
%% runs/<signal-session>/revisions/<configuration-hash>/ under the PythonAnywhere home.
%% scripts/strategy_archive_identity.py derives the v2 ID from session, strategy and config.
%% scripts/strategy_pipeline.py and scripts/strategy_archive_companions.py read the archives.
sequenceDiagram
    participant S as PythonAnywhere
    participant P as Strategy producer
    participant A as Alpaca
    participant W as Webull Sandbox
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant M as Primary Pipeline

    S->>P: Start 1568725 at 01:20 UTC using the prepared launcher
    Note over P: Acquire run locks<br/>Check qualification before using Webull
    P->>A: Read the exchange calendar
    A-->>P: Exchange sessions

    alt No trading session that New York date
        P-->>S: Skip the non-trading day
    else Completed trading session
        P->>A: Capture tradable equities, IEX bars and corporate actions
        A-->>P: Market data for the session
        Note over P,A: daily_strategy_scan.py<br/>Prepare one shared dataset<br/>Save each scan and manifest
        P->>D: Archive required companion scans
        P->>A: Request raw minute bars for scanner finalists
        A-->>P: Return available regular and after-hours bars
        opt A finalist's data is missing or stale
            P->>W: Request only the missing symbol and session window
            W-->>P: Return available supplemental bars
        end
        Note over P,W: Webull closes at 20:00 ET on regular days<br/>Use 17:00 ET for listed 13:00 ET early closes
        P->>D: Commit bars, providers and coverage in the primary archive<br/>jbravo_research.research_runs
        P->>D: Read back committed rows separately
        alt All required strategy archives complete
            P-->>S: Save completion.json and exit successfully
        else A required capture, scan or archive fails
            P-->>S: Record failure and exit nonzero
            Note over P,D: Earlier archive rows can remain as partial results.
        end
    end

    S->>M: Start task 1568726 on its own schedule
    M->>A: Resolve the completed signal session
    A-->>M: Exchange sessions
    M->>D: Look up the archive ID for that session, strategy and config
    D-->>M: Return the matching archive row and hashes if present
    Note over D,M: Verify archive hashes<br/>Check session files<br/>Repeat for companions
    alt Required archives and files pass validation
        Note over D,M: Run Backtest and Metrics<br/>Replay archived price evidence and publish paper limits
    else A required archive or file is missing or invalid
        M-->>S: Block primary completion
    end
